+ * GalaxyCore GC02M2 2MP MIPI CSI-2 image sensor driver
+ *
+ * Ported from the Rockchip vendor driver to the mainline V4L2 subdev and
+ * CCI APIs, following the gc05a2 driver.
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2026 Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
+ */
